# Build artifacts (regenerable, huge)
/target

# Raw run outputs: full transcripts, per-trial sandboxes, cost/latency numbers,
# and machine-specific data. Never commit — it bloats history and can leak
# details about whoever ran the eval (prompts under test, model, spend, paths).
# The versioned record of "how the suite scored" is the distilled report in
# baselines/, not this tree.
/results

